This repository is the ECHELON SUBSTRATE: the engine, the bank schema, the
recall and reflex machinery, and the discipline that drives them.

It does NOT contain the maintainer's own earned bank. Atoms are earned by use,
and an earned bank is private working memory — see the "What is not here"
section of README.md. Nothing in this repository is derived from, or discloses,
any third party's data.
